(Use `node --trace-deprecation ...` to show where the warning was created)

Refusing to run: --no-migrate, and this run would upgrade the schema above.
  Nothing was written and the snapshot was discarded. Three ways on from here:
    - run it without --no-migrate, accepting the change above;
    - copy the file first and point this script at the copy, keeping a5.db as it is;
    - run it with no flags for the review sheet, which never writes to the file at all.


